{
  "id": "zh-b1-bei",
  "category": "Mandarin B1",
  "language": "zh",
  "title": "Passive & Causative: 被, 让 / 叫, 把 vs 被",
  "description": "Something happens to the subject (被, usually unpleasant), someone makes / lets someone do something (让), and telling 把 from 被.",
  "level": "B1",
  "points": [
    {
      "id": "bei_basic",
      "title": "Subject + 被 (+ doer) + verb + …",
      "summary": "被 (bèi) = passive. The subject suffers the action; the doer is optional. Like 把, the verb needs a result or 了.",
      "body": "- 我的自行车**被**(人)偷了.\n- 他**被**老师批评了.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{我|wǒ}{的|de}{自行车|zìxíngchē}{被|bèi}{人|rén}{偷|tōu}{了|le}。",
          "My bike got stolen."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bei_neg",
      "title": "没 + 被",
      "summary": "Negation goes before 被: 没被….",
      "body": "- 我的钱包**没被**偷.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{还好|háihǎo}，{我|wǒ}{的|de}{钱包|qiánbāo}{没|méi}{被|bèi}{偷|tōu}。",
          "Luckily my wallet wasn't stolen."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rang",
      "title": "让 / 叫 + person + verb: make / let",
      "summary": "让 (ràng) / 叫 (jiào) + person + verb = make / tell / let someone do something.",
      "body": "- 妈妈**让**我去买牛奶.\n- 老师**让**我们写作业.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{老师|lǎoshī}{让|ràng}{我们|wǒmen}{写|xiě}{作业|zuòyè}。",
          "The teacher made us do homework."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ba_vs_bei",
      "title": "把 vs 被",
      "summary": "Doer + **把** + thing + verb (the doer is the subject). Thing + **被** + doer + verb (the thing is the subject).",
      "body": "- 风**把**门吹开了 (The wind blew the door open).\n- 门**被**风吹开了 (The door was blown open by the wind).",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{门|mén}{被|bèi}{风|fēng}{吹|chuī}{开|kāi}{了|le}。",
          "The door was blown open by the wind."
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
